{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_57D25D9B","title":"Lucy Lovelace, Style Consultant","entry":"Dlg_57D25D9B::entry","exit":"Dlg_57D25D9B::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_E7E15F12","articyId":"72057821671234439","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"This noodle stand - it doesn't know, what it wants to be. It has no direction.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"This noodle stand - it doesn't know, what it wants to be. It has no direction.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":975.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21664","byteOffset":16085688,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_88D8D05A","articyId":"72057821671234481","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"The attitude you chose for your place needs to attract the right kind of customers. Who is your target demographic? Workers? Hipsters? People with taste and money - like me?","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The attitude you chose for your place needs to attract the right kind of customers. Who is your target demographic? Workers? Hipsters? People with taste and money - like me?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2775.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18996","byteOffset":15073360,"byteLength":484}},{"id":"DFr_EBA830E6","articyId":"72057821671234530","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"Check your statistics. Your customer acquisition system knows the social status of each of your customers.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Check your statistics. Your customer acquisition system knows the social status of each of your customers.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":975.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41149","byteOffset":29895440,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_1C07FE51","articyId":"72057821671234594","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"I am frequently scandalized by the awful taste of the public. Try to choose something that appeals to a broad swathe of the masses.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I am frequently scandalized by the awful taste of the public. Try to choose something that appeals to a broad swathe of the masses.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":975.0,"y":750.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52006","byteOffset":34089440,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_BDE5C757","articyId":"72057821671234672","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"Personally I'd say it's a waste of time, but depending on your target group, you will need some.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Personally I'd say it's a waste of time, but depending on your target group, you will need some.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":975.0,"y":975.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48784","byteOffset":32793192,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_EBD6A641","articyId":"72057821671234372","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"Let's get to work on this place. What do you need to know?","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Let's get to work on this place. What do you need to know?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":375.0,"y":750.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49816","byteOffset":33189792,"byteLength":484}},{"id":"DFr_4DAB87CF","articyId":"72057821671234379","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Maybe you start with the basics?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Maybe you start with the basics?","TextSheVersion":"Maybe you start with the basics?","TextTheyVersion":"Maybe you start with the basics?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":675.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43474","byteOffset":30776512,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_3368FDF2","articyId":"72057821671234386","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"The profile of my customers. How do I learn more about my patrons?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The profile of my customers. How do I learn more about my patrons?","TextSheVersion":"The profile of my customers. How do I learn more about my patrons?","TextTheyVersion":"The profile of my customers. How do I learn more about my patrons?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":675.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45401","byteOffset":31508712,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_D827565A","articyId":"72057821671234393","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"How do I choose the right furniture for the right customers?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"How do I choose the right furniture for the right customers?","TextSheVersion":"How do I choose the right furniture for the right customers?","TextTheyVersion":"How do I choose the right furniture for the right customers?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":675.0,"y":750.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47267","byteOffset":32217552,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_E8031716","articyId":"72057821671234399","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What about decoration?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What about decoration?","TextSheVersion":"What about decoration?","TextTheyVersion":"What about decoration?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":675.0,"y":975.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17595","byteOffset":14546080,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_3310D73E","articyId":"72057821671234407","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I guess I'm fine for now.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I guess I'm fine for now.","TextSheVersion":"I guess I'm fine for now.","TextTheyVersion":"I guess I'm fine for now."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":675.0,"y":1200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22587","byteOffset":16432720,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_C1B07AAE","articyId":"72057821671234413","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"Alright.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Alright.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4275.0,"y":675.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39648","byteOffset":29328648,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_7EE92A90","articyId":"72057821671234446","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Well, it's a noodle stand.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, it's a noodle stand.","TextSheVersion":"Well, it's a noodle stand.","TextTheyVersion":"Well, it's a noodle stand."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1275.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30359","byteOffset":19366104,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_48B8FDD5","articyId":"72057821671234453","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"You have to dream a little larger darling. You're selling a concept, not just noodles.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You have to dream a little larger darling. You're selling a concept, not just noodles.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1575.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"34127","byteOffset":20792600,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_25608C37","articyId":"72057821671234460","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I thought we were selling noodles...","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I thought we were selling noodles...","TextSheVersion":"I thought we were selling noodles...","TextTheyVersion":"I thought we were selling noodles..."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1875.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45043","byteOffset":31373624,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_F55D392B","articyId":"72057821671234467","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"The noodles are just your entry ticket to the competition. To beat your rivals, you need attitude.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The noodles are just your entry ticket to the competition. To beat your rivals, you need attitude.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2175.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21585","byteOffset":16054160,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_93B52291","articyId":"72057821671234474","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What kind of \"attitude?\"","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What kind of \"attitude?\"","TextSheVersion":"What kind of \"attitude?\"","TextTheyVersion":"What kind of \"attitude?\""},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2475.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41177","byteOffset":29905096,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_AA29C9EB","articyId":"72057821671234495","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I guess I need to think about the type of customer I want to attract...","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I guess I need to think about the type of customer I want to attract...","TextSheVersion":"I guess I need to think about the type of customer I want to attract...","TextTheyVersion":"I guess I need to think about the type of customer I want to attract..."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3100.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28020","byteOffset":18481696,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_FE3342C3","articyId":"72057821671234510","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Not for now thanks.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Not for now thanks.","TextSheVersion":"Not for now thanks.","TextTheyVersion":"Not for now thanks."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3950.0,"y":675.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37694","byteOffset":28597672,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_50ED285F","articyId":"72057821671234518","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Yes, I have more questions.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yes, I have more questions.","TextSheVersion":"Yes, I have more questions.","TextTheyVersion":"Yes, I have more questions."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3950.0,"y":975.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51568","byteOffset":33925912,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_1A3BDACB","articyId":"72057821671234544","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"And then I go for the biggest group I guess?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And then I go for the biggest group I guess?","TextSheVersion":"And then I go for the biggest group I guess?","TextTheyVersion":"And then I go for the biggest group I guess?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1275.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36177","byteOffset":28033176,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_B77FD7BF","articyId":"72057821671234551","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"Sure, or you target a smaller demographic that doesn't have a place to go yet. Think beyond the mainstream.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sure, or you target a smaller demographic that doesn't have a place to go yet. Think beyond the mainstream.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1575.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33306","byteOffset":20484576,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_6FD07F34","articyId":"72057821671234558","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Alright.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Alright.","TextSheVersion":"Alright.","TextTheyVersion":"Alright."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1875.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50482","byteOffset":33440272,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_875697FD","articyId":"72057821671234565","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"It's about finding a gap in the market. For instance, there is currently no restaurant at all in the Stacks.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's about finding a gap in the market. For instance, there is currently no restaurant at all in the Stacks.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2175.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17539","byteOffset":14524768,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_6DA93572","articyId":"72057821671234579","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"None? There must be a reason for that...","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"None? There must be a reason for that...","TextSheVersion":"None? There must be a reason for that...","TextTheyVersion":"None? There must be a reason for that..."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2475.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45020","byteOffset":31365384,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_C36EAFCD","articyId":"72057821671234586","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"Might be worth the risk, though.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Might be worth the risk, though.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2775.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32296","byteOffset":20097680,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_300A8144","articyId":"72057821671234615","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"That sounds a bit cynical.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That sounds a bit cynical.","TextSheVersion":"That sounds a bit cynical.","TextTheyVersion":"That sounds a bit cynical."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1275.0,"y":750.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32291","byteOffset":20096064,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_6F798D96","articyId":"72057821671234622","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"I'm just being pragmatic. I know good taste, but I also know what people like. They seldom overlap.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm just being pragmatic. I know good taste, but I also know what people like. They seldom overlap.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1575.0,"y":750.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24010","byteOffset":16962848,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_B8601068","articyId":"72057821671234629","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"So how do I proceed?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So how do I proceed?","TextSheVersion":"So how do I proceed?","TextTheyVersion":"So how do I proceed?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1875.0,"y":750.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"34171","byteOffset":20810888,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_DE373066","articyId":"72057821671234636","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"Trial and error. Buy items and see how they effect your target group. If it resonates, commit to it, no matter how tacky their choices.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Trial and error. Buy items and see how they effect your target group. If it resonates, commit to it, no matter how tacky their choices.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2175.0,"y":750.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52168","byteOffset":34150968,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_2FDF599A","articyId":"72057821671234643","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"If not, store the tat away until you open a restaurant where it fits.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If not, store the tat away until you open a restaurant where it fits.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2775.0,"y":750.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39930","byteOffset":29435800,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_5C7CC8B7","articyId":"72057821671234650","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"So it will fit somewhere eventually? Got it.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So it will fit somewhere eventually? Got it.","TextSheVersion":"So it will fit somewhere eventually? Got it.","TextTheyVersion":"So it will fit somewhere eventually? Got it."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3100.0,"y":750.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40022","byteOffset":29470536,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_884FBFDD","articyId":"72057821671234686","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"So it comes down to the target group again?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So it comes down to the target group again?","TextSheVersion":"So it comes down to the target group again?","TextTheyVersion":"So it comes down to the target group again?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1275.0,"y":975.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37191","byteOffset":28411128,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_B09C6818","articyId":"72057821671234693","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"Tables and chairs only get you so far. It's the ornamentals that will send your venue into legendary status with your target group.","speakerId":"Ntt_5F1C53B5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Tables and chairs only get you so far. It's the ornamentals that will send your venue into legendary status with your target group.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1575.0,"y":975.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51016","byteOffset":33639832,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_A4924813","articyId":"72057821671234707","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"And I guess it's a trial and error principle: Buy the stuff and find out.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And I guess it's a trial and error principle: Buy the stuff and find out.","TextSheVersion":"And I guess it's a trial and error principle: Buy the stuff and find out.","TextTheyVersion":"And I guess it's a trial and error principle: Buy the stuff and find out."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1875.0,"y":975.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27514","byteOffset":18290400,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_11DDC04B","articyId":"72057821671234714","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Lucy Lovelace","text":"Did we talk about furniture yet? Same principle. Exploit their bad taste and give the people wha